Package: golfastr
Type: Package
Title: Efficiently Access Pro Golf Data
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ray", "Carpenter", email = "raymondcarpenter1@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Fetch professional golf tournament data from ESPN
    <https://www.espn.com/golf/>, including leaderboards and hole-by-hole
    scoring for the PGA Tour, LIV Golf, LPGA, DP World Tour, and Champions
    Tour. Data is returned in tidy 'tibble' format. Completed PGA Tour
    seasons are served from hosted files for fast repeated access. Supports
    local storage via RDS or 'Apache Arrow' Parquet files.
